From 0f50a6465882a2076c00600e930305562a83cfe8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Eugene <eugene@local>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 22:29:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rebuild program for hypertrophy: fix volume gaps, add
 arm/calf/hamstring work

Session A:
- RDL 3->4 sets, barbell/trap bar instead of DBs (removes grip cap)
- Incline DB Press 3->4 sets
- Add Chest-Supported DB Row 3x10-12; Rear Delt demoted to C2 2x15
- Add Cable Pushdown 3x10-12 (triceps were at zero)
- Pallof/Farmer's renumbered to D1/D2

Session B:
- Goblet Squat -> Hack Squat or Leg Press 4x8-10 (loadable past grip limit)
- Assisted Chin-Up 3->4 sets
- DB Step-Up -> Lying Leg Curl 3x10-12 (hamstrings were at 3 sets)
- Pec Fly promoted from D to B2, 2->3 sets
- Add DB Curl and Standing Calf Raise
- Dead Hang moved to E

Weekly hard sets: chest 5->7, back 9->12, hams 3->7, arms 0->3+3, calves 0->3.
Quads 9->7 by design - fewer sets, none grip-limited.

App:
- Storage keys now use stable data-id instead of DOM index, so reordering
  exercises no longer shifts saved weights between lifts
- One-time v2->v3 weight migration maps old slots to new IDs
- Third Plan tab: week layout, volume audit, progression, SkiErg protocol
- updateProgress guards panes with no exercises
- SW cache v2 -> v3
